test/fixture/tooltip_tokens/tokens.tsv lists the $(kind=id.field) tokens of every text that a
tooltip column of Spell4 names (the seven localizedTextId columns ActionBarTooltip,
CasterIconSpellText, PrimaryTargetIconSpellText, SecondaryTargetIconSpellText,
TooltipCastInfo, TooltipCostInfo and LASTier), read from en-US.bin of the WildStar client
build 16042 (ClientDataEN) and Spell4.tbl of the same build. Only the text id, the token's kind,
its id and its field name are kept: no English text of the client is copied. Written and
checked by `python3.13 -I .claude/skills/decoding-the-client/scripts/client_files.py tokens
--write` and `tokens --check`; the full check runs --check when the client's files are present.
